Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:10:00.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能是逃避警卫的压力造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:03.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did you get the stethoscope and pressure cuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:03.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你哪来的听诊器和血压袖带？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My Aunt Marion gave them to me for my 12th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:06.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玛丽安姑姑送我的12岁生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She thought if I failed at theoretical physics that I should have a trade to fall back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以防我理论物理学没出息 可以委屈当医生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And by the way, the blood pressure cuff is called a sphygmomanometer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 这袖带的正确名称为血压计
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Didn't teach you that in medical school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -医学院没教你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm kind of busy here. -I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我有事要忙了 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I need is for you to authorize these tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只拜托你 批准我做这些检验就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha. A cardiac stress test, a full-body MRI, an electromyogram...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}心脏负荷测试、全身核磁共振 肌动电流图
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:33.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a CBC, baseline glucose, upper GI?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:33.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血全图、基线血糖和上消化道检测
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:37.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and exploratory laparoscopy. The last time I had hiccups...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:37.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有腹腔镜探查 我上次打嗝时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it felt like my diaphragm was just going through the motions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的横隔膜好像移了位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:42.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go home, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回家去 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:44.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I at least have the upper GI?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:44.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}起码做个内视镜吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I already drank the barium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经喝了钡剂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good. Do you have any fabric softener?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 你有衣物柔顺剂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What, are you washing a crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么倒那么多？洗鳄鱼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:10.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. The pants that Stephanie got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:10.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 是史黛芬妮买给我的裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sweetie, you can't machine wash these. They'll be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这件不能用洗衣机洗 会洗坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You sure? -Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你确定？ -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no. I wish you'd told me that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糟糕 你应该早点说的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you guys having problems? -No. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们感情出问题了？ -没有 都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yeah, it's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？ -对 美妙极了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, maybe this whole living together happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 或许同居这件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...kind of suddenly, but it's fine, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点突然 但没关系 很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Leonard, if you're uncomfortable with the way things are going...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事情的进展若让你不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're allowed to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以对她表达
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure? That doesn't sound right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定？听来不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:50.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Believe me, your feelings are just as important as hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:50.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 你的感觉 和她的感觉同等重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:54.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that doesn't sound right either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:54.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…这句话听起来也不对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:59.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell her you need the relationship to move at a pace you both are comfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:59.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉她你希望感情进展的速度 是双方都自在的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I could say something like that to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这句话我还敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll go do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.14,0:12:05.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这就去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a really good grasp on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你对这件事的见解精辟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you could talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.19,0:12:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去跟她谈好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:20.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:20.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:23.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:23.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是 不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去跟她谈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:31.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wanna come with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:31.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要陪我去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:38.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:49.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:49.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:52.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were right. Your larynx is terribly inflamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:52.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说对了 你的喉头严重发炎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I mean, I've never seen anything like it. -I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我从没看过这么糟糕的 -我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna need to stop talking, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得立刻停止说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-For how long should--? -Eh, eh, eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要多久…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}立刻停止
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Oh, hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:24.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:24.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just performed a Sheldon-ectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮谢尔顿“切除”了肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Careful. If you don't get it all, it'll only come back worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要小心 切除不完全的话 复发会更惨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:33.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Gotcha. -Listen, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.94,0:13:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我懂了 -我有事要跟你说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do we need to talk, or do we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是轻松聊天还是严肃对谈？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:43.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂你的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:47.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, why don't you just tell me what it is you have to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:47.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你直接说出你想告诉我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:52.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, look, it's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:52.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个…是这样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...things between you and me have been going pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你我之间的感情进展得有一点快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:59.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And? -It's just a little scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:59.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以？ -让我有一点害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:02.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah, but scary good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:02.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那好 害怕是好事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:08.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When is scary not good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:08.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害怕始终是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But-- Okay. Um, I have feelings, right? -Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但…这样说吧 我也有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:17.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, and it's perfectly okay to express those feelings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:17.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我可以表达我的感觉 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course. Why don't you tell me what you're feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 快告诉我你有什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, I ju-- I think it's important to remember that we move...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我认为不能忽略… 感情的进展…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:29.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at a pace that is our speed and....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:29.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须以…双方共同的…速度…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:32.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, shoot, I had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:32.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可恶！我都背好了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how about this? How about I tell you what I'm feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不如这样 我来告诉你我的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？现在？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:45.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -I just ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:45.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不行吗？ -我刚吃饱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't you supposed to wait an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:48.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是要等一小时吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think that's for swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Ah. Okay. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.52,0:14:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那好 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hope I don't get cramps. -Yeah.
